| `at <time>` | Schedule a one-time task |

**Cron syntax:**
```
*  *  *  *  *  command
│  │  │  │  │
│  │  │  │  └── day of week (0-6)
│  │  │  └───── month (1-12)
│  │  └──────── day of month (1-31)
│  └─────────── hour (0-23)
└────────────── minute (0-59)
```

```bash
# Run backup script every day at 2:30 AM
30 2 * * * /home/user/scripts/backup.sh

# Run every 5 minutes
*/5 * * * * /home/user/scripts/healthcheck.sh
```

